#====================================================================
# DRAFT-bandit-2.0.0-abstract-non-virtual-dtor-libcxx.kv
# 旧 C++11 抽象基类无虚析构在现代 libc++(-ohos) 被
# -Wdelete-abstract-non-virtual-dtor 拦截：补虚析构即修（bandit 2.0.0 实证）
# 触发事件: bandit 2.0.0 HarmonyOS PC 适配（archives/b/bandit/2.0.0，r01）
#====================================================================

id:                     DRAFT-bandit-2.0.0-abstract-non-virtual-dtor-libcxx
trigger_tool:           clang|libc++|make|cmake
phase:                  compilation|linking
error_signature:        delete called on .* that is abstract but has non-virtual destructor|
                         -Wdelete-abstract-non-virtual-dtor|
                         non-virtual destructor|abstract.*destructor

severity:               2
category:               cxx, compatibility, libcxx, header-only, portability
match_keywords:         abstract, non-virtual destructor, virtual destructor, unique_ptr,
                         delete, libc++, libcxx-ohos, libcxx, -Werror, C++11, UB,
                         failure_formatter, Wdelete-abstract-non-virtual-dtor
title:                  旧 C++11 抽象基类无虚析构，被现代 libc++ 诊断（-Wdelete-abstract-non-virtual-dtor）连同项目 -Werror 硬拦截；补 virtual 析构即修复 UB

root_cause: >
  C++11 时代三方库的抽象基类常缺虚析构（如 bandit 2.0.0 的
  bandit::detail::failure_formatter），但通过 std::unique_ptr<基类> 持有派生对象
  并 delete —— 经基类指针 delete 派生对象而基类无虚析构是 UB。现代 libc++
  （含 OHOS SDK libc++-ohos）新增该编译期诊断，项目 -Werror 使其成为硬错误。

rec_priority:           1
rec_approach:           add-virtual-dtor-to-abstract-base
rec_description: >
  最小补丁：给抽象基类增加空实现虚析构 `virtual ~X() {}`，消除 UB 并满足诊断；
  补丁放入 patches/，conandata patches 用列表形式声明
  （patch_file/patch_description/patch_type: portability）。
rec_command:            git diff -- bandit/exception.h bandit/failure_formatters/failure_formatter.h
rec_auto_fix:           false
rec_impl:               patch-virtual-dtor

fallback_priority:      2
fallback_approach:      disable-warning
fallback_description:   临时用 -Wno-delete-abstract-non-virtual-dtor 关闭诊断绕过，属掩盖 UB，须记录并尽快补虚析构。
fallback_command:
fallback_auto_fix:      false

affected_scope:         旧 C++11/C++03 头文件库在现代 libc++（libc++-ohos 等）下编译报该诊断的通用修复。
verification_cmd:       CMAKE_POLICY_VERSION_MINIMUM=3.5 make -C build bandit-specs && ./build/bin/bandit-specs --no-color --reporter=dots

similar_to:
caused_by:
prerequisite_of:
conflicts_with: